#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064180 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064054 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "caf358b8-31fb-5587-8663-f414317c42be" :knowledge-point/title "Integrating Secant Squared"}] :question/id #uuid "3d2bde25-f8dc-5e62-9999-6593424f0ae2" :question/math-academy-id "e-384" :question/problem "Calculate the integral $\\displaystyle{\\int} (2\\sec^2 x + \\sec x \\tan x )\\, \\textrm{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\int \\sec^2 x \\, \\textrm dx = \\tan x + C\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\int \\sec x \\tan x \\, \\textrm dx = \\sec x + C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t\\int (2\\sec^2 x + \\sec x \\tan x )\\, \\textrm{d}x& = 2 \\int \\sec^2 x \\, \\textrm{d}x+ \\int \\sec x \\tan x \\, \\textrm{d}x \\\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&=2\\tan x + \\sec x + C.\n\n}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "caf358b8-31fb-5587-8663-f414317c42be" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050321}] :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186479316 :question-generator/id #uuid "0a6231a4-3e55-57f1-b5d3-f9553fadf14a" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186064180.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064560 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "caf358b8-31fb-5587-8663-f414317c42be" :knowledge-point/title "Integrating Secant Squared"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a006523e-4d4e-5a63-94dd-bdac892a6969" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\cot z + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186061556} {:answer/id #uuid "e4eb330d-7371-510d-91f4-8f7067b295fd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\sec z\\tan z + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186061557} {:answer/id #uuid "1d1e9e39-ebca-54ef-a928-ea2553f8e492" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\tan z + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186061558} {:answer/id #uuid "1e8d4ed3-8561-52c9-ba3d-b